SUMMARY:La Milonguita Nota Negra
LOCATION:NOIR café\, Graefestraße 82\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: La Milonguita Nota Negra \n----------\nThe darker the 
 night\, the sweeter the dance.\nEntrée 2 € — donations welcome\n\n- A
 peritif - 18:00 -19:00\n\nPRACTICA\nA Taste of Tango\n\nA relaxed space to
  practice together\, share ideas\, and ask anything you’d like.\nA first
  sip of rhythm- a slow awakening for the senses\n\n- Main Course - 19:00
 –22:00\nLa Milonguita Nota Negra\n\nA rich blend of Argentine classics a
 nd hidden gems\, carefully seasoned by \n- DJ mojokojo\n\nBest enjoyed wit
 h drinks\, served alongside with tempting bites \;)…\n\n Lean in. Let th
 e night melt on your tongue\, each step a lingering bite of dark chocolate
 \, each glance a sip of red wine\, let your steps follow the flavor of the
