BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:493657@hoy-milonga-berlin
DTSTAMP:20260912T183000Z
DTSTART:20260912T183000Z
DTEND:20260912T223000Z
SUMMARY:La Raíz Milonga
LOCATION:Tangotanzen macht schön (TTMS)\, Oranienstraße 185\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: La Raíz Milonga\n----------\nTango class for all leve
 ls:\n- 19:15–20:30 Seba & Sheena\nMilonga: from \n- 20:30 Tango Traditio
 nal \n- Dj Sebastian Marco (Buenos Aires)\n\nA warm and welcoming space fo
 r dancers of all levels\, hosted at Tangotanzen macht schön in Kreuzberg.
 \n\nEntry: 12 €.\nReduced entry: 10 € before 21:00.\nUrban Sport plus 
 5 euro.\nIf you come to class\, the milonga is 5 euros.\n\nContact: 003934
 28321817\n\nA new milonga is born in Berlin.\nLa Raíz Milonga\n\nA raíz 
 is a root. It is where we come from\, what sustains us\, and what allows u
 s to grow.\n\nInspired by the essence of Argentine Tango\, La Raíz is a s
 pace for connection\, listening\, and shared experience. A place where the
  embrace comes before the figures\, where music guides the movement\, and 
 where every tanda becomes a conversation.\n\nIn a city that is constantly 
 moving\, we invite you to return to the roots: the pleasure of dancing\, m
 eeting\, and being present.\n\nJoin us for an evening of tango\, encounter
 s\, and community.\n\nBack to the roots\, forward through the embrace.\n\n
 Tangotanzen macht schön – Berlin\nLa Raíz Milonga\n----------\nQuelle:
  https://www.facebook.com/sebastian.marco.98\n\nVeranstalter: Sebastian Ma
