 0\n- Milonga: 20:00 – 01:00\n\n We’ll have an open buffet – bring fo
 od\, drinks\, something to share\, and let’s make it a real community ta
 ble.\n\nMixed level class where we switch roles and partners. You don't ha
 ve to be fit in both roles yet.\n\n- Prices: Milonga Sliding scale (Selbst
 einschätzung) between 7-12€ | Class 10€ | Class & Milonga 15 € | US
 C accepted for either the class or the milonga\n\n- Now (at least) every 1
 st & 3rd Thursday! Next dates: October 1 & 15\n\nPS: We are looking for vo
 lunteers to help us with the set up\, take down and reception. You can enj
 oy the class and milonga for free. Just message us \n---------\nQuelle: ht
 tps://www.facebook.com/LaLunaImprovisada\n\nVeranstalter: La Luna Improvis
